i-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Classic_Biome\" title=\"Classic Biome\">Classic Biome</a> | Ferwater</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Classic_Store\" title=\"Classic Store\">Classic Store</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$125</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Decor</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.57.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">June 6th, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p><p><i><big>\"Quack! Quack Quack! QUACKKKKK!!!! QUAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACCCCCCCCCCCCCKKKKKKKKKKKKKKK\"</big></i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Baby Ducky</b> is a special item bought in the <a href=\"/wiki/Classic_Store\" title=\"Classic Store\">Classic Store</a> for $125. It is part of the random rotation in the store. This is a small rubber duck that quacks when it comes into contact with something.\n</p><p>When buying, there is a chance that the duck will become Evil. Evil duck does not change its description and name, it differs only in appearance.\n</p><p>A duck will become an Adult if you place it in the <a href=\"/wiki/Duck_Shrine\" title=\"Duck Shrine\">Duck Shrine</a>. The green particles are replaced by yellow ones. Works with both ducks. An Adult Duck is 4 times the size of a Baby Duck.\n</p><p>Also, the chance of getting an Evil Duck is about 1 in 75 and 1 in 125.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902224216\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.034 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.042 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 58/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 62/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019438/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   36.207      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   36.207      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:2944-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260902224216 and revision id 17002. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Ducks"],"links":[{"title":"Classic Biome","exists":true},{"title":"Classic Store","exists":true},{"title":"Duck Shrine","exists":true}],"images":["Baby_Ducky.png","Baby_Ducky_Evil.png"]}
